{"seq":9,"slug":"ui-ux-design","title":"UI/UX 设计","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design","rating":{"composite":4.31,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"前端-ui-ux-设计-简介\">前端·UI/UX 设计 简介</h1><p>UI/UX 设计是数字产品开发中不可或缺的关键环节。UI（用户界面）关注产品的视觉呈现与交互元素，UX（用户体验）聚焦用户在使用产品全过程中的感受与满意度。优秀的 UI/UX 设计能显著提升产品的易用性、可访问性和用户留存率，直接影响商业成功。本 hub 面向<strong>前端开发者</strong>：不是教你成为专职设计师，而是让你具备「读懂设计稿、识别坏设计、与设计师高效协作、把设计意图无损落地为代码」的工程化能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-讲什么-不讲什么\">本 hub 讲什么 / 不讲什么</h2><p>本 hub 覆盖<strong>设计的认知与决策层</strong>：视觉感知规律、色彩排版间距的取值依据、组件交互模式、设计系统与 Token 体系、设计工具与协作流程。它回答的是「为什么这样设计、取哪个值、何时用哪种模式」。</p>\n<p>它<strong>不</strong>深入工程实现细节——那些由兄弟 hub 承担，本 hub 在相关处用相对链接指过去，不重复展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>本 hub 的角色</th>\n<th>去哪个兄弟 hub 看实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Design Token 的工程化构建（Style Dictionary、多平台产物、CI 校验）</td>\n<td>只讲 Token 的设计语义与三层模型</td>\n<td><code>../18_design-systems-tokens/</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无障碍的代码落地（ARIA 模式、屏幕阅读器、键盘陷阱）</td>\n<td>只讲 WCAG 原则与设计期检查</td>\n<td><code>../34_web-accessibility/</code>、<code>../16_accessibility-i18n/</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSS 实现（变量、容器查询、层叠层、主题切换工程）</td>\n<td>只讲设计取值与视觉规律</td>\n<td><code>../06_css-and-visual-engineering/</code>、<code>../36_modern-css-architecture/</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Web 动画的实现技术（WAAPI、GSAP、性能）</td>\n<td>只讲微交互的设计原则与时长曲线</td>\n<td><code>../22_web-animation/</code>、<code>../45_frontend-microinteractions/</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表单的工程（校验库、受控/非受控、状态机）</td>\n<td>只讲表单的可用性设计</td>\n<td><code>../43_frontend-form-engineering/</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据可视化的图表工程</td>\n<td>只讲数据展示的信息设计</td>\n<td><code>../49_frontend-data-visualization/</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>本 hub 决定「做什么、取什么值、为什么」，兄弟 hub 决定「用什么代码实现」。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;1 设计原则&lt;br/&gt;感知/可用性/流程&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;2 色彩与排版&lt;br/&gt;视觉取值依据&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;3 组件设计&lt;br/&gt;交互模式&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;4 设计系统&lt;br/&gt;Token/组件库/协作&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;5 设计工具&lt;br/&gt;Figma/原型/AI&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"1 设计原则&lt;br/&gt;感知/可用性/流程\"] --&gt; B[\"2 色彩与排版&lt;br/&gt;视觉取值依据\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"3 组件设计&lt;br/&gt;交互模式\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"4 设计系统&lt;br/&gt;Token/组件库/协作\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"5 设计工具&lt;br/&gt;Figma/原型/AI\"]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>前置知识</strong>：HTML/CSS 基础、对 Flexbox 的理解（理解 Figma Auto Layout 会更快）。无需任何美术功底。</li>\n<li><strong>章节一（设计原则）</strong> 是认知地基，格式塔与 CRAP 是后续所有视觉决策的「物理定律」，应最先读。</li>\n<li><strong>章节二（色彩与排版）</strong> 给出可直接落地的取值体系（8px 网格、字号阶梯、对比度阈值）。</li>\n<li><strong>章节三（组件设计）</strong> 是日常前端最高频的部分，可在地基之上随取随用。</li>\n<li><strong>章节四（设计系统）</strong> 面向规模化团队，与 <code>../18_design-systems-tokens/</code> 配合阅读。</li>\n<li><strong>章节五（设计工具）</strong> 是协作与交付的工具层，含 2025 年 Figma Config 后的新能力与 AI 辅助现状。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"各章节速览\">各章节速览</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>1 设计原则</strong>：<a href=\"design-principles/gestalt-principles\">格式塔</a>、<a href=\"design-principles/crap-principles\">CRAP</a>、<a href=\"design-principles/usability-and-accessibility\">可用性与无障碍</a>、<a href=\"design-principles/ux-design-process\">UX 流程</a></li>\n<li><strong>2 色彩与排版</strong>：<a href=\"color-and-typography/color-theory\">色彩理论</a>、<a href=\"color-and-typography/typography-hierarchy\">排版层级</a>、<a href=\"color-and-typography/spacing-grid-whitespace\">间距网格</a>、<a href=\"color-and-typography/dark-mode-design\">暗色模式</a></li>\n<li><strong>3 组件设计</strong>：<a href=\"component-design/buttons-and-forms\">按钮与表单</a>、<a href=\"component-design/navigation-patterns\">导航</a>、<a href=\"component-design/cards-lists-data\">卡片列表与数据</a>、<a href=\"component-design/modals-and-feedback\">模态与反馈</a></li>\n<li><strong>4 设计系统</strong>：<a href=\"design-systems/design-tokens\">Design Token</a>、<a href=\"design-systems/component-library\">组件库</a>、<a href=\"design-systems/theming-and-branding\">主题与品牌</a>、<a href=\"design-systems/design-dev-collaboration\">设计开发协作</a></li>\n<li><strong>5 设计工具</strong>：<a href=\"design-tools/figma-workflow\">Figma 工作流</a>、<a href=\"design-tools/prototyping\">原型与交互</a>、<a href=\"design-tools/design-review\">设计评审</a>、<a href=\"design-tools/ai-assisted-design\">AI 辅助设计</a></li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"design-principles","title":"设计原则","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/design-principles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gestalt-principles","title":"格式塔原理与视觉感知","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/design-principles/gestalt-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"crap-principles","title":"对比对齐重复亲密","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/design-principles/crap-principles"},{"seq":3,"slug":"usability-and-accessibility","title":"可用性与可访问性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/design-principles/usability-and-accessibility"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ux-design-process","title":"用户体验设计流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/design-principles/ux-design-process"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"color-and-typography","title":"色彩与排版","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/color-and-typography","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"color-theory","title":"色彩理论与调色板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/color-and-typography/color-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"typography-hierarchy","title":"字体选择与层级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/color-and-typography/typography-hierarchy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"spacing-grid-whitespace","title":"间距网格与留白","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/color-and-typography/spacing-grid-whitespace"},{"seq":4,"slug":"dark-mode-design","title":"暗色模式设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/color-and-typography/dark-mode-design"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"component-design","title":"组件设计","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/component-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"buttons-and-forms","title":"按钮与表单组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/component-design/buttons-and-forms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"navigation-patterns","title":"导航与信息架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/component-design/navigation-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cards-lists-data","title":"卡片列表与数据展示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/component-design/cards-lists-data"},{"seq":4,"slug":"modals-and-feedback","title":"模态框与通知反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/component-design/modals-and-feedback"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"design-systems","title":"设计系统","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/design-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"design-tokens","title":"Design Token 与变量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/design-systems/design-tokens"},{"seq":2,"slug":"component-library","title":"组件库架构与文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/design-systems/component-library"},{"seq":3,"slug":"theming-and-branding","title":"主题系统与品牌一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/design-systems/theming-and-branding"},{"seq":4,"slug":"design-dev-collaboration","title":"设计与开发协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/design-systems/design-dev-collaboration"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"design-tools","title":"设计工具实战","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/design-tools","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"figma-workflow","title":"Figma 核心工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/design-tools/figma-workflow"},{"seq":2,"slug":"prototyping","title":"原型与交互设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/design-tools/prototyping"},{"seq":3,"slug":"design-review","title":"设计评审与交付","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/design-tools/design-review"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ai-assisted-design","title":"AI 辅助设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/ui-ux-design/design-tools/ai-assisted-design"}]}]}